      "evidence": "metasystem/internal/testpolicy/contractmerge/merge.go:151-186 (mergeGenerated). Probe: merged=[{Paths:[bundle/*.js] Command:[build]} {Paths:[bundle/** extra/**] Command:[build]}] err=<nil> validate=<nil>.",
